        "type": "thinking",
        "thinking": "I'm working through the dhātu स्कुम्भ् (परस्मैपदी) and deriving its liṭ uttama dvivacana form, चुस्कुम्भिव, by applying reduplication to स्कुम्भ्.\n\nAfter abhyāsa, halādiḥ śeṣaḥ reduces स्कु to just क्, which then undergoes kutva to become चु, giving the reduplicated abhyāsa चु. Since लिट् after a saṃyogānta root isn't कित् (असंयोगाल्लिट् कित् doesn't apply here), the nasal in स्कुम्भ् is retained, so the final form is चुस्कुम्भिव.\n\n",
